  <prompt>The Search screen fails with "SearchContainers(...): The call failed, please try again." Using the real error surface from task 001, isolate the actual root cause and fix it. The leading hypothesis is the app-only auth root cause from spec §3.1, but that is a hypothesis — confirm it empirically, do not design around it.</prompt>

  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in Microsoft Graph /search/query, SPE container search, and OBO vs app-only permission models. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>

  <goal>The Search screen returns results against the Spaarke Dev tenant. The confirmed root cause is recorded in task notes.</goal>

  <context>
